<title>UK: Millennium Chemicals offers to buy discount notes.</title>
<headline>Millennium Chemicals offers to buy discount notes.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Millennium Chemicals Inc today offered on behalf of Millennium America Inc (formerly Hanson America Inc) to purchase for cash its 2.39 percent senior exchangeable discount notes due 2001.</p>
<p>It will include the attached rights to exchange the notes for Hanson Plc American Depositary Shares (ADS's).</p>
<p>The price is $883.27 per $1,000 due at maturity which is equivalent to 101 percent of the accreted value of the notes at the expiry date of the offer -- December 17, 1996 -- plus accrued interest.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7718</p>
</text>
